# SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
# Scene hl1-garg (test/README.md): hldemo1's garg room: the glimpse trigger
# (glimpse_garg), the cave-in (cavein2_mm, the vent pops and falls), the
# vent's north leg onto garg_vent_break, the drop over the garg room, the
# garg killing garg_sci_1 and kicking the CPU (cpu_debris_*):
# uplink.route lines 696-731 with the vent crawl's long east leg replaced by
# its x 1200 point (route ops 512-525: after WAIT_NEAR 2083 -232 518 ..
# SHOT garg-look).
# scene-window: uplink 512 garg-look
startmap hldemo1
waitmap hldemo1 60
setpos -2048 744 36
wait 0.3
drop item_suit -2048 744 36
drop weapon_crowbar -2048 744 36
wait 1
god 1
setpos 530 -110 36 0 0
waitgone glimpse_garg 20
# cave-in trigger (#319) -> cavein2_mm -> launch_mm: vent pops and falls
setpos 720 -180 36 0 0
waitgone pop 5
waitgone vent_fall_crate_2 10
# the vent crawl (uplink 707-715) from x 1200 (where the route starts
# swinging the crowbar) to its east end, ducked (a setpos straight to the
# east end leaves the player stuck there)
setpos 280 -232 36 0 0
+duck
wait 0.5
impulse 1
setpos 1200 -232 400 30 0
wait 0.3
+forward
+attack
waitnear 2083 -232 518 6 60
stats begin
-forward
+moveleft
waitnear 2072 64 482 16 20
-moveleft
+back
waitgone garg_vent_break 30
-back
-attack
wait 2
-duck
# garg kicks the CPU after killing garg_sci_1 (debris 3..5 s later)
waitgone cpu_debris_3 40
shot garg
# the garg itself (the shot above frames the vent it came through)
lookat monster_gargantua
shot garg-look
stats end
wait 0.2
pass
